# Pi-hole exact allows - imported by `make import-allowlist`
#
# Each entry overrides a gravity (adlist) block that broke a real device. Keep
# the reason next to every entry: an allow with no recorded cause cannot be
# reviewed later. Exact domains only - no wildcards here.

# LG ThinQ (LG fridge, 2026-11-06). Both are on StevenBlack/hosts. Wi-Fi
# onboarding fails at ~99% with "no internet connection" while they resolve
# to 0.0.0.0; the rest of *.lgthinq.com is not listed and resolves normally.
aic-common.lgthinq.com
common.iot.aic.lgthinq.com
